{
  "song_id":243099,
  "title":"Passe mon truc",
  "language":"fr",
  "lyricists":[

  ],
  "lyrics":[
    {
      "section_id":"section_0",
      "type":"couplet1",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"- Heu salut, c'est toi le dj?",
          "rhyme":"adZ",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Ouais c'est bien ouais",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Ouais alors je te laisse une cassette c'est la musique que je fais",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Et si t'as le temps de la passer... 'fin bon, jte la laisse là",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Tiens j'te la met là",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABBCC",
      "rhyme_vowel":"ABBAA"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_1",
      "type":"couplet2",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"- Hey hey hey ouais salut on c'etait vu talleur",
          "rhyme":"9R",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Et jt'avais laisser une tite cassette et ouais",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Ah, ah tu la passe après ce morceau là, okay c'est cool",
          "rhyme":"ul",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABC",
      "rhyme_vowel":"ABC"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_2",
      "type":"couplet3",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"- Ouais c'est encore moi",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Tu m'avais dis que t'allais passer mon truc apres ce morceau",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Euh en fait t'as oublié j'crois mais...",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"D'accord... D'accord, juste après Lenny Kravitz, okay",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABCC",
      "rhyme_vowel":"ABCC"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_3",
      "type":"couplet4",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"- Putain mais tu vas la passer ma cassette",
          "rhyme":"Et",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Et y a personne là",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Alors putain mais passe la merde !",
          "rhyme":"ERd",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"...Ouais, c'est ça, c'est ça",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Et en plus Sunday Bloody Sunday tu l'as passé trois fois",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"...Ouais c'est ça",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"En fait tu fais genre le dj...",
          "rhyme":"adZ",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Mais c'est genre t'aimes pas la musique",
          "rhyme":"ik",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Et t'as aucun respect",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABCBBBDEF",
      "rhyme_vowel":"ABABBBBCA"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_4",
      "type":"couplet5",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"- Maintenant tu dégage !",
          "rhyme":"aZ",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"J'vais la passer ma cassette",
          "rhyme":"Et",
          "persona":"pophip",
          "persona_id":"pophip"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"AB",
